flowchart TD
    SHARD[Training shard] --> GHOST[Ghost model utility score]
    GHOST --> BENCH[Benchmark loss delta proxy]
    BENCH --> GRAD[Gradient similarity check]
    GRAD --> BATCH[Batch composition]
    BATCH --> FLOOR{Below always-on floor?}
    FLOOR -->|yes| ACCEPT[Accept - floor protected]
    FLOOR -->|no| THRESH{Utility above 0.15?}
    THRESH -->|yes| ACCEPT
    THRESH -->|no| REJECT[Reject shard]
    ACCEPT --> TRAIN[Pretrain step]
    REJECT --> DISCARD[Discard queue]
